{"id":"vod_lz_69992","vodId":"69992","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"双子星公主","name_cn":"双子星公主","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230827-1/02a32d94ca18a5edda495a3f5adb0b73.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在美丽的不可思议星球上，这颗和平的星球上有七个国家，每一个国家各司其职，维系着这颗星球平稳的转动着。然而某一日，身为星球中心的太阳王国之中却发生了异常，这也就意味着，这颗星球在极短的时间内就将要崩溃。此时，法音（小岛惠美 配音）和莲音（后藤邑子 配音）两位太阳果的公主出现了，拯救了这次危机。　　之后，两人离开了太阳星球，来到了皇家奇迹星球，在这里，树立着皇家奇迹学校，在这所学校里就读的，是来自与各国的公主与王子们，他们要在此取得成为皇后与国王的资格，方可毕业回国。学校里的课业紧张，竞争激烈，法音和莲音能否承受住压力，坚持到最后呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-27 18:04:00","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36812_95a31752/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36814_8d01140f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36816_0969382d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36815_2ad73f89/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36813_7493cd7d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36845_54386545/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36817_1b70a037/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36841_f690a0a1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36818_9ca003fb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36819_c94123c9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36820_81a42cad/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36821_996dea8e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36822_06164533/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230825/36823_988c7287/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"htt